        <mxCell id="lbl-modeG" value="MODE G: grits product — 16.22 t/h" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1b5e20;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="408" width="230" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-note-modes" value="TWO OPERATING MODES (client 2026-08-14):&#10;MODE G — grits production: diverter to product; RC.2 gap 3.4 mm; dryer at its full 32.1 t/h limit; grits 16.22 + fines 13.57 t/h.&#10;MODE F — fines campaign: 2/3.75 diverted to RC.2 regrind; gap 1.5 mm; feed 25.05 t/h; fines 23.2 t/h, no grits; fines 98.9 % below 1.7 mm.&#10;ANNUAL SPLIT (two-mode planning): 2 466 h G + 1 144 h F = 60.2 % — grits 40 000 + fines 60 000 t/y EXACTLY." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1565c0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0d47a1;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="380" width="360" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-note-perf" value="LINE RESULT (engine, annual two-mode plan):&#10;KFS 85 000 + grits 40 000 + fines 60 000 + AgLime 108 000 baseline (20 % market margin held as flex) — LANDFILL 0 at the adopted quarry curve (40.1 % below 20 mm at the zone-1 inlet).&#10;KFS Yield self-consistent at 28.3 %.&#10;Zones 1.1 / 1.2 / 1.3: 62.7 / 36.0 / 60.2 %." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1b5e20;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="580" width="360" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-note-tags" value="* STUDY TAGS — final numbers to be assigned in the plant codification on adoption of the detailed design (proposal: SC.A takes the SN.21 slot, SC.B a new SN.2x, RC.1/RC.2 new CR.2x, DV.GF a DV.2x tag; formal codification by NACO). All other tags are verified as-built references. Purchase specs: RC.1 32 t/h; RC.2 2 x 22 t/h, gap range down to 1.5 mm (vendor gradation test to confirm, with n_comp / S_att and the D6 margin)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#8a8f98;dashed=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5a5f68;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="750" width="360" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-footer" value="Engine runs: run_scenario zone_1_3_mode = G / F + run_required_hours (two-mode plan), converged x2 grid, 2026-08-14. Sliver routing = regrind (client); grits diverter DV.GF = the mode selector. Dryer auxiliaries (BU.04, FI.05/FN.06) unchanged, omitted for clarity. Quarry works spec: docs/design/zone13-redesign/quarry-works-specification.md." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#5a5f68;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="920" width="1450" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
